E
locker portal infernal unknown drak~
   Within is only darkness...  Sticking one's hand through the portal proves
the darkness to be viscous and exceedingly cold.  Any disturbance in the portal
summons forth pairs of glowing, white orbs that can only be speculated on
belonging to some hellish entities that reside within.  Further investigation
shows an ornately carved cairn within grasping distance of the portal.  Its
craftsmanship belies the skill for which only the dwarves are known and it is
decorated with infernal symbols that seem to be a testament to brief past life.
~
B
