statue morlock hellish locker eye~
From head to toe this being is swathed in &07pitch black clothing.&00
His &07black&00 hair shaved into a closely cropped mohawk stands in a
sharp contrast to his pale white flesh. He is poised in a crouching 
position as if preparing to leap out and sink is abnormaly long canine
teeth into your soft skin. On the bottom of the statue written in blood
is the phrase, "Incarta Denium Elastia Fin"
~
